    "bio": "Manu Bhaker is an Indian sport shooter specializing in pistol events. She became the first Indian woman to win an Olympic medal in shooting, securing a bronze in the 10m Air Pistol at the Paris 2024 Olympics. She also won a second bronze in the 10m Air Pistol Mixed Team event at the same Games, making her the first Indian to win two medals in a single Olympic edition. Bhaker has achieved numerous gold medals at World Cups, Commonwealth Games, and Asian Games.",
